# Generated by the toolchain on every build and typecheck, never hand-edited.
# Tracked until P2-16, which meant every build dirtied the working tree of every
# session in this repository and each one had to run git checkout -- on them
# before staging. That reflex is the danger: applied to a file that was
# genuinely edited, it discards real work.
# Both stay ON DISK. Next regenerates next-env.d.ts on the next build, and
# losing tsconfig.tsbuildinfo costs one slow typecheck and nothing else.
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# P2-11: dosarul de build folosit de serverul de productie din suita.
.next-prod
